_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"UGefDZNmnBztS0eoXWtHyQ","review_id":"mRtJCEpFKnxl8Q7NVR46Kw","date":"2013-08-15T21:12:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9620983600616455,"text_excerpt":"Twas my second time eating food from the joint, but my first time actually eating in the place and it's a cool little spot. There are some cool postings on the walls but what stood out most was the aroma of smoked meats and deliciousness all around. I was simply salivating. I've had their brisket which is really good, but those pork ribs with potato salad and macaroni just did it for me. Honestly i'm not much the red meat type but they were really good, be sure not to forget to put some of that table sauce on it tho. I was tearing into mine so much i only got to half of the last piece before i discovered the truth about it all. Most definitely the place to go to for BBQ in NOLA"},{"business_id":"UGefDZNmnBztS0eoXWtHyQ","review_id":"OZNhPuzCOpXbE_3696mJBw","date":"2015-10-13T14:12:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9541753530502319,"text_excerpt":"Being raised in the West Coast, I pretty much assumed every southern state would be saturated with BBQ. After moving to New Orleans, good BBQ wasn't as common as I expected. I decided to try The Joint after a quick search on yelp. I ordered the 2 meat combo with Ribs and Brisket with Macaroni and cheese and also ate some of my friend's pulled pork and beans. Ribs: Delicious! Fall off the bone, moist and tons of flavor. Cooked to perfection. They cook their ribs with dry rub Memphis style which is how I prefer it. Their ribs are pretty meaty. Brisket: Very flavorful and not dry. Again cooked to perfection with the outside slightly burnt for the perfect crunchiness. Pulled Pork: Seasoned pe..."},{"business_id":"UGefDZNmnBztS0eoXWtHyQ","review_id":"JQ-UT4xBcX6JbkspcTNU5Q","date":"2012-04-19T18:53:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9541124105453491,"text_excerpt":"Oh how I love BBQ, especially when it's done right. The Joint did not disappoint! Fantastic food, tons of it, and a great price for what you get. If you come here check out their smoker out back too. I definitely recommend coming here. It was cool to get out of the touristy part of the city and take in a neighborhood place. There are a few dive bars within a couple of blocks to go to after since The Joint closes down pretty early."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"UGefDZNmnBztS0eoXWtHyQ","photo_id":"YESecj8ax-KqBm7uQD8qaw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/YESecj8ax-KqBm7uQD8qaw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8526764512062073},{"business_id":"UGefDZNmnBztS0eoXWtHyQ","photo_id":"j5cCtd9sQqEz1F2iXLUwQQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/j5cCtd9sQqEz1F2iXLUwQQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8274595141410828},{"business_id":"UGefDZNmnBztS0eoXWtHyQ","photo_id":"RPZESSe8MTSdhoKB9U2aIQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/RPZESSe8MTSdhoKB9U2aIQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8218157291412354},{"business_id":"UGefDZNmnBztS0eoXWtHyQ","photo_id":"eFHBtvwDPBkznwgIbrkYhA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eFHBtvwDPBkznwgIbrkYh